id=MTK_D8100_Vulkan1.4.Panvk
name=Dimensity 8100 PanVK WSI7 (Vulkan only)
version=1.1.1
versionCode=13
author=wxcvm; upstream zenithblue-oss
description=PanVK WSI7 1.1.1 FINAL (performance-clean) for PGKM10/Android 17. Same functional fixes as 1.1.0 (GPU-uncached imports for the SystemUI shareability fault, one-shot Android acquire replay for WeChat, AFBC YU10 Vulkan import, SurfaceFlinger skiavkthreaded support) but built without the bring-up diagnostics: diagnostic trace patches and per-image logging were removed, so image create/import hot paths no longer log to logcat. HWUI Vulkan stays disabled because ColorOS/Skia aborts on vendor 10-bit AHB. See docs/PERFORMANCE-REVIEW.md and docs/FINAL-REPORT.md.
